Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:54:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs(formats): the format notes' facts generated from the
 recordings, and checked

observed.rs computes, per harness and record kind, every field the
baseline's recordings carry (shape, required or optional) and the
versions they name; docs/agents/formats/observed/<harness>.md holds it,
generated. tests/observed.rs fails when a table is stale, a note does
not link its table, or a recording carries a record kind or version the
notes never name. The notes name the recordings' versions (Claude Code
2.1.132 and 2.1.285, Codex 0.128.0, Copilot 1.0.68, opencode 1.14.41),
entry-types.md describes cost-state, and the index corrects the Copilot
line.
